          %h2#references References
          %p The notion of hyperring and hyperfield is due to:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marc+Krasner"}> Marc Krasner
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Approximation des corps valués complets de caractéristique
