          %p
            Applications to the geometry over the “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+with+one+element"}> field with one element
            ”:
          %ul
            %li#ConnesConsani11
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alain+Connes"}> Alain Connes
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Caterina+Consani"} Caterina Consani
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The hyperring of adèle classes
                %strong 131
                2 (2011) 159-194 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1001.4260"}> arXiv:1001.4260
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jnt.2010.09.001"} doi:10.1016/j.jnt.2010.09.001
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alain+Connes"}> Alain Connes
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
